---
// Sets the wallet's storage network (lib/networkName.ts) from the first script
// on the page. Module scripts run in document order, and passkey-sdk `nidoKey`
// throws until the network is set, so a component that reads storage (the
// sidebar's account name) must not depend on a page script further down
// having done it. NidoLayout renders this first in <head>.
---

<script>
  import "../lib/networkName";
</script>
